WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.670
White Leaf's Germicidal and Therapy Lights are designed to work with young heifers.

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.110
Understanding the thickness of the heifer's hide is critical.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.630
Red light penetrates deep, through the hide and skin,

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.070
and even into the eyes.

00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:17.590
Inside the body, it boosts cellular energy, called ATP,

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:21.930
and stimulates collagen, helping develop the newborn heifer's immune system,

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:25.310
supporting joints and muscles, and improving circulation.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.330
Blue light works in a different way.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.870
Continuous, low-level violet-blue light is deadly to harmful bacteria,

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.030
yet it's safe for continuous exposure, and harmless to people and animals.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.830
It sanitizes the calf huts and feeding equipment, for a cleaner environment around the calf.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.830
White Leaf Technology Group.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:46.680
Visit whiteleafled.com.
